+         row  `DeviceCreationUnsupported(path)`  10  _the special device entry at `path` could not be created on this filesystem_  `extractTo` が FIFO やデバイスに出会ったか、`archive[Tar]` が tar の格納できない子孫に出会った場合
+         row  `WriteUnsupported`  11  _TAR archives cannot yet be opened for writing_  `Write` のモードでの `open[Tar]`。書き込みには `create[Tar]` を使うか、`Tarfile` を書く
+         row  `AlreadyExists`  12  _an archive already exists at this path_  `CreateFlag.Replace` なしの `create[Tar]`
+         row  `CannotWrite(detail)`  13  _the archive could not be written: `detail`_  `create[Tar]` 中の I/O の失敗

